From ee3271034f58bdbf1feb5358704d63493143c9f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VideoPlayerGold snapshot <jestar001@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 21:37:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vf_dlssnr: GPU-resident neural relight filter through a
 runtime host library

Plumbing only (CUDA nv12/p010 in, own pool out, ordered after decode on a
private stream, up to 3 frames in flight, fail-open). Colour conversion,
the network and the optional round-trip downscale live in a host library
loaded at runtime across the C ABI in nrhost.h.
